{
  "title": { "zh": "给方向响应装上抗干扰结构", "en": "Stabilise directional responses" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "两条有符号的读数解释了变化方向，但有些边缘同时在两个方向上有响应。把方向分量变成一项强度后，再看带细纹的台阶：干净图上可用的读数，在噪声里会晃动。",
        "en": "The two signed readings describe direction, and some edges respond along both axes. After combining those readings into a single strength, inspect a step with a fine pattern: a measurement that works on a clean image can fluctuate in noise."
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "\\[M=\\sqrt{g_x^2+g_y^2}\\]\n\ngx、gy 是 Sobel 的两个带符号分量，M 是它们的长度。平方后相加再开方，让横向和纵向贡献不会因正负相反而抵消。Sobel 在求差分的垂直方向做平滑来减轻干扰，但 M 仍只是变化证据，不代表已识别物体。 <wiki-ref to=\"sobel-measurement\"></wiki-ref>",
    "en": "\\[M=\\sqrt{g_x^2+g_y^2}\\]\n\ngx and gy are the signed Sobel components; M is their length. Squaring before addition prevents opposite signs from cancelling. Sobel smooths perpendicular to differentiation to reduce nuisance, but M is evidence of change, not object recognition. <wiki-ref to=\"sobel-measurement\"></wiki-ref>"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "v1_strength",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": {
        "zh": "先合并方向强度",
        "en": "Measure directional strength"
      },
      "stage": { "zh": "梯度强度", "en": "Gradient strength" },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "保留两个带符号的读数，再交付一张强度图。对比反向台阶，强度应相同；两方向都有变化时，不能彼此抵消。",
        "en": "Keep both signed readings and produce a strength image. Opposite steps should have the same strength, and simultaneous changes along the two axes must not cancel."
      },
      "after": {
        "zh": "\\[M=\\sqrt{g_x^2+g_y^2}\\]\n\ngx、gy 是互相垂直的变化分量。它们构成一个二维向量，M 是长度；长度不受分量符号影响，而 gx+gy 可能把强变化相互抵消。 <wiki-ref to=\"gradient-components\"></wiki-ref>",
        "en": "\\[M=\\sqrt{g_x^2+g_y^2}\\]\n\ngx and gy are perpendicular change components. Together they form a vector whose length is M. Length does not cancel opposite signs, whereas gx+gy can hide strong change. <wiki-ref to=\"gradient-components\"></wiki-ref>"
      },
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "image", "label": { "zh": "图", "en": "Image" } }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        { "name": "gx", "label": { "zh": "横向响应", "en": "Horizontal response" } },
        { "name": "gy", "label": { "zh": "纵向响应", "en": "Vertical response" } },
        { "name": "strength", "label": { "zh": "变化强度", "en": "Gradient strength" } }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [
              [0, 0, 1],
              [
                0,
                1,
                1
              ]
            ]
          },
          "expect": {
            "gx": [
              [0, 0.5, 0.5],
              [0.5, 0.5, 0]
            ],
            "gy": [
              [
                0,
                0.5,
                0
              ],
              [0, 0.5, 0]
            ],
            "strength": [
              [0, 0.7071067811865476, 0.5],
              [0.5, 0.7071067811865476, 0]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [
              [0.8, 0.1],
              [0.2, 0.7],
              [0.9, 0.4]
            ]
          },
          "expect": {
            "gx": [
              [-0.35000000000000003, -0.35000000000000003],
              [0.24999999999999997, 0.24999999999999997],
              [-0.25, -0.25]
            ],
            "gy": [
              [-0.30000000000000004, 0.3],
              [0.04999999999999999, 0.15000000000000002],
              [0.35, -0.14999999999999997]
            ],
            "strength": [
              [0.46097722286464443, 0.4609772228646444],
              [0.2549509756796392, 0.291547594742265],
              [0.4301162633521313, 0.291547594742265]
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [],
      "solution": [
        "dx = const[kind=weights,first=0.5,centre=0,last=-0.5]()",
        "dy = transpose(dx)",
        "v = spatialProcessor[form=dense,outside=clamp](image,dx)",
        "vY = spatialProcessor[form=dense,outside=clamp](image,dy)",
        "m = magnitude(v,vY)",
        "gx <- v",
        "gy <- vY",
        "strength <- m"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "dx = const[kind=weights,first=0.5,centre=0,last=-0.5]()",
        "dy = transpose(dx)",
        "v = spatialProcessor[form=dense,outside=clamp](image,dx)",
        "vY = spatialProcessor[form=dense,outside=clamp](image,dy)",
        "m = arithmetic[op=add](v,vY)",
        "gx <- v",
        "gy <- vY",
        "strength <- m"
      ],
      "naiveWhy": {
        "zh": "同时看两个方向都有变化的位置，以及符号相反的位置。保留分量是为了区分方向，长度负责合并强度。",
        "en": "Inspect locations changing in both directions and with opposite signs. Components retain direction; length combines strength."
      },
      "adds": ["magnitude"],
      "carry": "1-7",
      "sample": {
        "inputs": {
          "image": {
            "size": [32, 24],
            "base": 0.15,
            "layers": [
              { "shape": "disc", "cx": 10, "cy": 12, "r": 6, "v": 0.8 },
              { "shape": "rect", "x": 21, "y": 4, "w": 8, "h": 15, "v": 0.55 },
              { "shape": "checker", "cell": 2, "lo": 0.25, "hi": 0.65, "x": 3, "y": 19, "w": 13, "h": 5 }
            ],
            "noise": { "seed": 17, "amp": 0.04 }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "v1_sobel",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": {
        "zh": "组合方向与强度",
